   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ELI402 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 10 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13746 · Decision 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 27/11/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ELI402 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>10 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13746 · QĐ 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 27/11/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Analyze sources of meaning loss and apply equivalence strategies to preserve propositional and pragmatic meaning.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Apply advanced interpreting principles across academic, public, and workplace settings to deliver context-appropriate renditions.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Evaluate argumentative discourse and justify ethical decisions in interpreting, including AI ethics (privacy, bias, attribution, confidentiality).</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Analyze register levels and shades of meaning and determine appropriate target-language choices, using AI suggestions as probes with human verification.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Produce formal-register interpretations that are concise, accurate, and stylistically balanced.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Analyze policy speeches and render coherent interpretations of key claims and supporting evidence.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Apply core political/economic concepts to ensure domain accuracy in interpreting, and verify terminology with trusted resources and AI quality-checks.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td><strong>CLO8</strong></td><td>Analyze culturally bound references, implicatures, and humor and choose appropriate transfer strategies.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>9</td><td><strong>CLO9</strong></td><td>Apply accurate equivalents or illustrate effective paraphrases for Latinisms and loan expressions, noting usage constraints.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>10</td><td><strong>CLO10</strong></td><td>Demonstrate teamwork (turn-taking, co-interpreter support) and professional conduct (punctuality, confidentiality).</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13746\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13746</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13746\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13746</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
